### =====================================================================
### Bloom & Co. API - manual tests (no Postman account needed)
###
### How to use:
###   1. Install the VS Code extension "REST Client" (by Huachao Mao).
###   2. Start the backend:  cd backend  ->  .\mvnw.cmd spring-boot:run
###   3. Click "Send Request" above any request below. The response opens on the right.
###   4. Always run the LOGIN request of a section first - the token is reused
###      automatically by the requests under it.
### =====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api


### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 0. HEALTH - is the server running and the database connected?
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/health


### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. PUBLIC CATALOGUE (no login)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### All flowers, most popular first
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?sort=popular&limit=12

### Search + price filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?search=rose&minPrice=5000&maxPrice=30000&sort=price_asc

### Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/categories

### One flower with reviews and related flowers
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/red-roses

### Current special offers
GET {{baseUrl}}/promotions/active

### Store settings + gift options
GET {{baseUrl}}/settings/public

### Contact form
POST {{baseUrl}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Visitor",
  "email": "visitor@example.com",
  "phone": "0788123456",
  "subject": "Wedding flowers",
  "message": "Do you deliver bridal bouquets to Musanze?"
}


### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. AUTH
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### Register a new customer (change the email each time you run it)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Customer",
  "email": "test{{$randomInt 1000 99999}}@example.com",
  "phone": "0788555111",
  "password": "Flowers@2026",
  "confirmPassword": "Flowers@2026",
  "address": { "province": "Kigali City", "district": "Gasabo", "sector": "Remera", "street": "KG 11 Ave, House 5" }
}

### Register with bad data -> 400 with the list of validation errors
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "A", "lastName": "", "email": "not-an-email", "phone": "123", "password": "weak", "confirmPassword": "x" }

### Wrong password -> 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "melissa@example.com", "password": "WrongPassword1" }


### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. CUSTOMER  (run "Login as customer" first)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name customerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "melissa@example.com", "password": "Customer@123", "remember": true }

###
@customerToken = {{customerLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Who am I
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Customer dashboard (summary cards + recent orders)
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Add 2 Red Roses to the cart
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 }

### View cart (subtotal, delivery fee, total)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Change quantity to 3
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/cart/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 3 }

### Add a flower to the wishlist
POST {{baseUrl}}/wishlist/2
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Saved delivery addresses
GET {{baseUrl}}/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Checkout preview: gift wrap + greeting card + promo code
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "giftOptions": ["gift_wrap", "greeting_card"], "promoCode": "BLOOM10" }

### Place the order (paid with MTN Mobile Money, delivered in 2 days)
# @name placeOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact": { "fullName": "Melissa Ineza", "phone": "0788111222", "email": "melissa@example.com" },
  "delivery": {
    "province": "Kigali City", "district": "Gasabo", "sector": "Kimihurura",
    "street": "KG 9 Ave, House 12", "locationDescription": "Blue gate next to the pharmacy",
    "date": "{{$datetime 'YYYY-MM-DD' 2 d}}", "time": "10:00 - 12:00"
  },
  "instructions": "Please call me when you arrive.",
  "message": { "recipientName": "Sarah", "type": "birthday", "text": "Happy Birthday Sarah! May your day be as beautiful as these flowers." },
  "giftOptions": ["gift_wrap"],
  "promoCode": "BLOOM10",
  "payment": { "method": "mtn_momo", "phone": "0788111222" }
}

###
@orderId = {{placeOrder.response.body.$.order.id}}

### My orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Track the order just placed (items, history, delivery, payment)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Payment declined demo: numbers ending in 0000 are declined -> 402
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact": { "fullName": "Melissa Ineza", "phone": "0788111222", "email": "melissa@example.com" },
  "delivery": { "province": "Kigali City", "district": "Gasabo", "sector": "Kimihurura", "street": "KG 9 Ave", "date": "{{$datetime 'YYYY-MM-DD' 2 d}}", "time": "10:00 - 12:00" },
  "payment": { "method": "mtn_momo", "phone": "0788110000" }
}

### RBAC: a customer must NOT see the admin dashboard -> 403 Forbidden
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/admin-dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}


### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. STAFF  (run "Login as staff" first)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name staffLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "aline.staff@bloomandco.rw", "password": "Staff@123" }

###
@staffToken = {{staffLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Staff dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/staff-dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### New (pending) orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Confirm the order placed in section 3
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "confirmed", "note": "Confirmed by phone" }

### Move it on: preparing
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "preparing" }

### Deliveries list
GET {{baseUrl}}/deliveries
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Available couriers
GET {{baseUrl}}/deliveries/couriers
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Customers
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers?search=melissa
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Contact messages
GET {{baseUrl}}/contact
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Update stock (allowed for staff)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/1/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stock": 50 }

### RBAC: staff must NOT create products -> 403 Forbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Should fail", "price": 1000, "stock": 1 }


### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. ADMIN  (run "Login as admin" first)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@bloomandco.rw", "password": "Admin@123" }

###
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Admin dashboard (stats + chart data)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/admin-dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Sales over the last 90 days
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/sales?days=90
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Activity log (MongoDB documents) + infrastructure status
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/activity
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### All products incl. inactive
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/admin/all
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create a product
# @name newProduct
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Peonies",
  "description": "Created from VS Code",
  "categoryId": "1",
  "price": 21000,
  "discountPercent": 5,
  "stock": 10,
  "occasions": ["wedding"],
  "status": "active"
}

### Update its price and stock
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/{{newProduct.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price": 19500, "stock": 12 }

### Delete it
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/{{newProduct.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Staff list
GET {{baseUrl}}/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Add a staff member
POST {{baseUrl}}/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "New",
  "lastName": "Courier",
  "email": "courier{{$randomInt 1000 99999}}@bloomandco.rw",
  "phone": "0788000199",
  "password": "Courier@2026",
  "staffRole": "delivery_staff"
}

### Payments (with collected / outstanding totals)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Promotions
GET {{baseUrl}}/promotions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Reviews
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Settings
GET {{baseUrl}}/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Orders report as CSV (this year)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/orders.csv?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
